a|vanilla extract]]\n* ¼ cup peach nectar\n* 1 tbsp [[Cookbook:Lemon|lemon]] [[Cookbook:Zest|zest]], finely grated\n\n=== Fruit ===\n* 3 ripe yellow [[Cookbook:Peach|peaches]], halved and pitted\n* 2 red [[Cookbook:Apple|apples]], cored and halved\n* 4 [[Cookbook:Plum|plums]], halved\n\n== Special equipment ==\n\n* 8 wooden [[Cookbook:Skewer|toothpicks]], soaked in water 30 minutes\n\n== Procedure ==\n#Combine all syrup ingredients in a large [[Cookbook:Saucepan|saucepan]], and bring to a [[Cookbook:Boiling|boil]] over high heat until reduced by ⅓. Set aside until cool.\n#Skewer plums through the side on the toothpicks. [[Cookbook:Brush|Brush]] cut side of all fruits liberally with syrup, and place syrup-side down on a medium high [[Cookbook:Grill|grill]] until marked.\n#Remove from grill, and serve warm with remaining syrup.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using apple]]\n[[Category:Recipes for sauces and condiments]]\n[[Category:Recipes for dessert]]\n[[Category:Recipes using peach]]\n[[Category:Grilled recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using white sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using plum]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon zest]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Grilled Summer Fruit","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"¼ cup unsalted butter, melted","sourceText":"¼ cup unsalted butter, melted","amountText":"¼ cup unsalted butter, melted","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"¼ cup white granulated sugar","sourceText":"¼ cup white granulated sugar","amountText":"¼ cup white granulated sugar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1 tbsp pure vanilla extract","sourceText":"1 tbsp pure vanilla extract","amountText":"1 tbsp pure vanilla extract","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"¼ cup peach nectar","sourceText":"¼ cup peach nectar","amountText":"¼ cup peach nectar","amou